#. ja: 帰還
#. de: Fortschicken
#. fr: Renvoyer
#. column 1: Dismiss your companion from battle.
msgctxt "BuddyAction:2:0:0"
msgid "Withdraw"
msgstr "Отозвать"

#. ja: バディを帰還させる。
#. de: Lässt deinen Mitstreiter wieder seiner Wege gehen.
#. fr: Renvoyer le compagnon.
#. column 0: Withdraw
msgctxt "BuddyAction:2:0:1"
msgid "Dismiss your companion from battle."
msgstr "Отозвать спутника из боя."

#. ja: 追従
#. de: Mitkommen
#. fr: Suivre
#. column 1: Order your companion to follow you.
msgctxt "BuddyAction:3:0:0"
msgid "Follow"
msgstr "Следовать"

#. ja: バディに自分についてくるように命令する。
#. de: Befiehlt deinem Mitstreiter, nicht von deiner Seite zu weichen.
#. fr: Ordonner au compagnon de vous suivre.
#. column 0: Follow
msgctxt "BuddyAction:3:0:1"
msgid "Order your companion to follow you."
msgstr "Приказать спутнику следовать за вами."

#. ja: フリーファイト
#. de: Freie Haltung
#. fr: Libre arbitre
#. column 1: Allow your companion to make his own decisions in battle.
msgctxt "BuddyAction:4:0:0"
msgid "Free Stance"
msgstr "Свободная боевая стойка"

#. ja: バディに、修得している全てのアクションを使って戦闘するように命令する。
#. de: Befiehlt deinem Mitstreiter, unter Einsatz all seiner Techniken an deiner Seite zu kämpfen.
#. fr: Ordonner au compagnon d'utiliser librement tous les types d'actions qu'il possède.
#. column 0: Free Stance
msgctxt "BuddyAction:4:0:1"
msgid "Allow your companion to make his own decisions in battle."
msgstr "Позволить спутнику самому принимать решения в бою."

#. ja: ディフェンダースタンス
#. de: Verteidigen
#. fr: Défendre
#. column 1: Order your companion to focus on defensive maneuvers, using only actions learned from the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Defender</ui-edge-color></ui-color> skill tree.
msgctxt "BuddyAction:5:0:0"
msgid "Defender Stance"
msgstr "Боевая стойка защитника"

#. ja: バディに、スキルリスト「DEFENDER」で修得したアクションを使って攻撃をするように命令する。
#. de: Befiehlt deinem Mitstreiter, dich mit stärkenden Verteidiger-Kommandos zu unterstützen.
#. fr: Ordonner au compagnon d'utiliser des actions de défense.
#. column 0: Defender Stance
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "BuddyAction:5:0:1"
msgid "Order your companion to focus on defensive maneuvers, using only actions learned from the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Defender</ui-edge-color></ui-color> skill tree."
msgstr "Приказать спутнику сосредоточиться на защите и использовать только умения из ветки <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>защитника</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: アタッカースタンス
#. de: Angreifen
#. fr: Attaquer
#. column 1: Order your companion to focus more on offensive maneuvers, using only actions learned from the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Attacker</ui-edge-color></ui-color> skill tree.
msgctxt "BuddyAction:6:0:0"
msgid "Attacker Stance"
msgstr "Боевая стойка атакующего"

#. ja: バディに、スキルリスト「ATTACKER」で修得したアクションを使って攻撃をするように命令する。
#. de: Befiehlt deinem Mitstreiter, seine Angreifer-Kommandos einzusetzen.
#. fr: Ordonner au compagnon d'utiliser des actions d'attaque.
#. column 0: Attacker Stance
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "BuddyAction:6:0:1"
msgid "Order your companion to focus more on offensive maneuvers, using only actions learned from the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Attacker</ui-edge-color></ui-color> skill tree."
msgstr "Приказать спутнику сосредоточиться на атаке и использовать преимущественно умения из ветки <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>атакующего</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: ヒーラースタンス
#. de: Heilen
#. fr: Soigner
#. column 1: Order your companion to stop fighting and concentrate on healing maneuvers, using only actions learned from the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Healer</ui-edge-color></ui-color> skill tree.
msgctxt "BuddyAction:7:0:0"
msgid "Healer Stance"
msgstr "Боевая стойка целителя"

#. ja: バディに、スキルリスト「HEALER」で修得したアクションを使って回復をするように命令する。
#. de: Befiehlt deinem Mitstreiter, sich nur auf seine Heiler-Kommandos zu konzentrieren.
#. fr: Ordonner au compagnon d'utiliser des actions de soin.
#. column 0: Healer Stance
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "BuddyAction:7:0:1"
msgid "Order your companion to stop fighting and concentrate on healing maneuvers, using only actions learned from the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Healer</ui-edge-color></ui-color> skill tree."
msgstr "Приказать спутнику прекратить бой и сосредоточиться на лечении, используя только умения из ветки <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>целителя</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
